{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80088,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c078122a0d758a004330a4e728a4f6ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Worn once for a few hours, no marks except under toes (see photo). True size 7. Have original box, plus forms and plastic bags for each shoe. Purchased from David&#039;s Bridal for $80 CAD + tax. Asking $40 CAD.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I&#039;m in Vancouver, BC, Canada. If you are local we can arrange to meet for you to try them on. Buyer pays shipping if required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913667,"PostDate":1463013557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(29,33,41);font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Worn once for a few hours, no marks except under toes (see photo). True size 7. Have original box, plus forms and plastic bags for each shoe. Purchased from David's Bridal for $80 CAD + tax. Asking $40 CAD.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I'm in Vancouver, BC, Canada. If you are local we can arrange to meet for you to try them on. Buyer pays shipping if required.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913667]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-47813500-1463027718.jpg\" title=\"FullSizeRender (12).jpg -  91.13KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-47813500-1463027718.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"FullSizeRender (12).jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913667]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-61172000-1463027779.jpg\" title=\"IMG_2880.JPG -  66.68KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-61172000-1463027779.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_2880.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913667]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-92887700-1463027785.jpg\" title=\"IMG_2879.JPG -  73.76KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-92887700-1463027785.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_2879.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913667]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-281283-0-11018600-1463027731.jpg\" title=\"IMG_2881.JPG -  77.06KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"