{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":147077,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that tiffanyt mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80074-hyatt-ziva-rose-hall\/?view=findpost&p=1913455\n\n----------------------------------\nHi @\"Toyal\"!\nI'm so happy to see another Ziva bride!  How has the process been for you so far? Do you know if you're going to be bringing a lot of things from home or will you be using their decor? How many guests are you expecting?\nI haven't been able to start the planning portion yet but I should be hearing from my coordinator Julianne soon about that. I'm hoping I won't have more than 80 guests but we are looking to invite about 130 so we'll see.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1462828639,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":147070,"Title":"liked a post you made in Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall","Message":"Hello!\n\ntiffanyt just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI hope your wedding was beautiful!  i am getting married there September 17, 2016!  it has been really difficult to find information, although my coordinator Donisha has been very helpful.  Would love any and all tips and suggested locations on your return!  Congrats!!!!...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80074-hyatt-ziva-rose-hall\/?view=findpost&p=1913443\n","Sender":{"Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1462812895,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"2","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
