{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.49.193.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91fb4cadf13684c73628140eea1989dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] In lighting related news, I finally got around to emailing JC and he told me that it&#039;s $150 per pole, plus $100 labour for setup\/removal. So perhaps I will go down this route after all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913818,"PostDate":1463525436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> In lighting related news, I finally got around to emailing JC and he told me that it's $150 per pole, plus $100 labour for setup\/removal. So perhaps I will go down this route after all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colenechow@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.49.193.173","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462582618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286896.jpeg?_r=1462600811","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VancouverGal","Id":286896,"Name":"VancouverGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"324737c133ee618c297e6e46b6e8a8da","RawContent":"@[member=\"VancouverGal\"] Huh wonder where I got the $400 from... Maybe that was the total cost? Anyhow, it pays to do your own research [emoji4] hope it works for you!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1913822,"PostDate":1463534207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> Huh wonder where I got the $400 from... Maybe that was the total cost? Anyhow, it pays to do your own research [emoji4] hope it works for you!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"632bb0aaf172a8545b5a9d61a1810eb0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, Congrats, do you have a photographer yet? i got some photos from Dreamart, outstanding work.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913967,"PostDate":1464012797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, Congrats, do you have a photographer yet? i got some photos from Dreamart, outstanding work.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"virginia.hermosillo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1463504611,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286968.jpg?_r=1464027691","PhotoWidth":165,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"virginiaherm","Id":286968,"Name":"virginiaherm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1464021168,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28ebd2a5133773a0fb7b2e2137c63c5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"VancouverGal\"] ! Welcome to the BDW forum community and congrats on your upcoming wedding ! You can find loads of info here and I hope I can help you with question #2 on your list about makeup as we specialize in airbrush makeup in tropical climates like the Riviera Maya, Mexico, and have experience with all skin types.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Perhaps our blog on airbrush makeup will be helpful:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can also learn more about us and see photos of our work here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80080-were-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80080-were-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If interested in more info, don&#039;t hesitate to contact us in this forum or via email at sales@stylingtrio.com. Thanks @[member=\"VancouverGal\"] and happy destination wedding planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913971,"PostDate":1464021128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> ! Welcome to the BDW forum community and congrats on your upcoming wedding ! You can find loads of info here and I hope I can help you with question #2 on your list about makeup as we specialize in airbrush makeup in tropical climates like the Riviera Maya, Mexico, and have experience with all skin types.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Perhaps our blog on airbrush makeup will be helpful:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-a-tropic-r2326<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can also learn more about us and see photos of our work here: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80080-were-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...o-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If interested in more info, don't hesitate to contact us in this forum or via email at sales@stylingtrio.com. Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> and happy destination wedding planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Dena DaSilva<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Online Concierge<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">US (+1) 713 589 4558<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">MX (+52) 984 803 2816<br>\nconcierge@stylingtrio.com<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Facebook: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">facebook\/stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Twitter:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Instagram:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Pinterest: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.pinterest.com\/stylingtrio<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/hapv1CMGpXYv2FEz6ZYtPWd2Y_yEKx8fi8QHoF6qa6giBtQe5Sq7Qu37JOO6-9XwSHFc1cI6Ke5Y2N3x9Ue9=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/stylingtrio.com\/Firmas\/Styling.jpg\" alt=\"Styling.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462465132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1463007029","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c54a42b4f67c67dd6530d5a8ee551ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"VancouverGal\"] I just saw your comments on my review. Sorry I missed them. There doesn&#039;t seem to be a way to get notifications for them. We&#039;ve already discussed lighting, but you asked what flavor cake we got. We just got vanilla. I would have done tres leches, but my hubby is lactose intolerant, so I didn&#039;t think something that translates to \"three milks\" was a good plan LOL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914129,"PostDate":1464829056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> I just saw your comments on my review. Sorry I missed them. There doesn't seem to be a way to get notifications for them. We've already discussed lighting, but you asked what flavor cake we got. We just got vanilla. I would have done tres leches, but my hubby is lactose intolerant, so I didn't think something that translates to \"three milks\" was a good plan LOL<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"42.113.16.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20c19e56b79b4b5868cedbdfd6b8c17a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hello all you new people&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914133,"PostDate":1464847287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hello all you new people<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.technology289.com\/2016\/01\/sua-chua-may-tinh-tai-nha-ha-noi.html'>s\u1eeda ch\u1eefa m\u00e1y t\u00ednh t\u1ea1i nh\u00e0<\/a>, chuy\u00ean \u0111\u00f4 m\u1ef1c m\u00e1y in v\u00e0 s\u1eeda laptop t\u1ea1i nh\u00e0","Email":"drizzle_tii@yahoo.com.vn","IpAddress":"42.113.16.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464845909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287061.jpg?_r=1465912480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"ThienThanh","Id":287061,"Name":"ThienThanh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50d5911b4564f3a383af1ab96b99ed12","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"VancouverGal\"] Welcome to the wonderful community we have going here at BDW! These forums will be exceptionally useful during your wedding planning.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nWe have been fortunate enough to work at Now Sapphire several times, and love it every time. Juan-Carlos is FABULOUS. Absolutely fabulous, can&#039;t say enough good things about him. I&#039;m very happy to hear you will assisted by him during these planning stages.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nAs for lighting, if you are curious of the different setups, both for the reception on the tequila terrace, as well as lighting for the dance floor that is opposite the dinner setup, I&#039;m including a few photos from Amber &amp;amp; Ross&#039;s wedding we photographed there. If you would like to see further highlights from their day, please follow the link to our portfolio page: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/amber-ross&#039;&gt;http:\/\/jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/amber-ross&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nYou might also like to check out the highlights from another wedding on the tequila terrace, where the couple opted to string lights and paper lanterns in the reception portion, and included party favours for the dance party:\n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/claudia-brad\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/claudia-brad\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nHope some of this information is helpful, and don&#039;t be shy to ask further questions based on our experiences at Now Sapphire. You can reply here, send us a PM, or even a direct email.\n\n\nCheers!\n\nJasmin &amp;amp; Matt\n\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35915,"Name":"Amber_Ross_Teaser_14.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-03781700-1465328643.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-03781700-1465328643_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35916,"Name":"Amber_Ross_Teaser_15.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-06454000-1465328659.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-06454000-1465328659_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35917,"Name":"Amber_Ross_Teaser_16.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-84724100-1465328683.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-84724100-1465328683_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200}],"Id":1914241,"PostDate":1465314656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> Welcome to the wonderful community we have going here at BDW! These forums will be exceptionally useful during your wedding planning.\u00a0<br><br>\nWe have been fortunate enough to work at Now Sapphire several times, and love it every time. Juan-Carlos is FABULOUS. Absolutely fabulous, can't say enough good things about him. I'm very happy to hear you will assisted by him during these planning stages.\u00a0<br><br>\nAs for lighting, if you are curious of the different setups, both for the reception on the tequila terrace, as well as lighting for the dance floor that is opposite the dinner setup, I'm including a few photos from Amber & Ross's wedding we photographed there. If you would like to see further highlights from their day, please follow the link to our portfolio page: <a href='http:\/\/jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/amber-ross' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/jasminandmatt...olio\/amber-ross<\/a><br><br>\nYou might also like to check out the highlights from another wedding on the tequila terrace, where the couple opted to string lights and paper lanterns in the reception portion, and included party favours for the dance party:<br><br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/claudia-brad\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jasminand...o\/claudia-brad\/<\/a><br><br>\nHope some of this information is helpful, and don't be shy to ask further questions based on our experiences at Now Sapphire. You can reply here, send us a PM, or even a direct email.<br><br>\nCheers!<br>\nJasmin & Matt<br><br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464781539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.42.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf847b496901e69b21fa2c5de3e43af2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"VancouverGal\"] Welcome to the BDW community and congrats on your upcoming wedding at Sapphire ! What a beautiful choice. This is a great forum to get all your questions answered and to help you plan your wedding to perfection!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You mentioned looking for a professional makeup artist that is good with working Asian brides as well as airbrush makeup. Well, you&#039;ve come to the right place! We at Styling Trio are pros at airbrush makeup and have loads of experience with different skin types. First I&#039;ll leave you with a great article about using airbrush makeup for your wedding in a tropical climate (Like Riviera Maya!) --&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Next, I&#039;ll attach our vendor page so you can see some photos of our work. We have a team of amazing professional hair and makeup artists and we&#039;re sure to make you look your very best on your special day. To learn more about us and check out photos of our work you can go here--&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We look forward to connecting with you! In the meantime @[member=\"VancouverGal\"] HAPPY PLANNING!! This is an exciting time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914253,"PostDate":1465332200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> Welcome to the BDW community and congrats on your upcoming wedding at Sapphire ! What a beautiful choice. This is a great forum to get all your questions answered and to help you plan your wedding to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You mentioned looking for a professional makeup artist that is good with working Asian brides as well as airbrush makeup. Well, you've come to the right place! We at Styling Trio are pros at airbrush makeup and have loads of experience with different skin types. First I'll leave you with a great article about using airbrush makeup for your wedding in a tropical climate (Like Riviera Maya!) -->\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-a-tropic-r2326<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Next, I'll attach our vendor page so you can see some photos of our work. We have a team of amazing professional hair and makeup artists and we're sure to make you look your very best on your special day. To learn more about us and check out photos of our work you can go here-->\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...o-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We look forward to connecting with you! In the meantime @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">VancouverGal<\/span><\/a> HAPPY PLANNING!! This is an exciting time.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Dena DaSilva<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Online Concierge<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">US (+1) 713 589 4558<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">MX (+52) 984 803 2816<br>\nconcierge@stylingtrio.com<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Facebook: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">facebook\/stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Twitter:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Instagram:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Pinterest: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.pinterest.com\/stylingtrio<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/hapv1CMGpXYv2FEz6ZYtPWd2Y_yEKx8fi8QHoF6qa6giBtQe5Sq7Qu37JOO6-9XwSHFc1cI6Ke5Y2N3x9Ue9=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/stylingtrio.com\/Firmas\/Styling.jpg\" alt=\"Styling.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462465132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1463007029","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1465391409,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d9363892dfa4628be4f73cfa0b867f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey there &lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/\" title=\"\"&gt;VancouverGal&lt;\/a&gt;!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum! The resort you chose has really nice locations. As fellow photographers were mentioning, there are many options for the reception lightning setups. We would recommend you to steer clear of laser effects in the lights (should they offer this to you) since they can become both a photographer and videographer&#039;s nightmare!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are highlights from a previous wedding we shot at the resort. Do you have any photo or video related questions we can help you with?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-13.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-27.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-2\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-39.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-3\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-46.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-65.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-6\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-76.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-7\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel free to browse our #WeddingsInTheSun galleries: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/category\/weddings-in-the-sun\/%C2%A0...and&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/category\/weddings-in-the-sun\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;... and&amp;nbsp;get destination wedding inspiration trough our #BeachWeddingTips:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;#&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/category\/beach-wedding-tips\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914267,"PostDate":1465391301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey there <span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286896-vancouvergal\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>VancouverGal<\/a>!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to the forum! The resort you chose has really nice locations. As fellow photographers were mentioning, there are many options for the reception lightning setups. We would recommend you to steer clear of laser effects in the lights (should they offer this to you) since they can become both a photographer and videographer's nightmare!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are highlights from a previous wedding we shot at the resort. Do you have any photo or video related questions we can help you with?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-13.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-1\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-27.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-2\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-39.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-3\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-46.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-4\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-65.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-6\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/images\/blog\/nowsafnestor\/now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-76.jpg\" alt=\"now%20yade%20nestor%20wedding%20cancun-7\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to browse our #WeddingsInTheSun galleries: <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/category\/weddings-in-the-sun\/%C2%A0...and' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingda...ngs-in-the-sun\/<\/a>\u00a0... and\u00a0get destination wedding inspiration trough our #BeachWeddingTips:<\/p>\n<p><a href='#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingda...h-wedding-tips\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">The WeddingDayStory Family<\/span> <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><em>Celebrating the Simple Romance of Weddings in the Sun<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Office (MX): +52 984 148 8653 \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Skype: WeddingDayStoryPhotoVideo<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\">Let's connect! \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TMeXMn22qXFltX6DJDe_AEo_GCBXvZ0lfEoQ1N-sDj8MqXTEyHVSyjBY3N6gvfGOnEulCpGxzXZijcD_pU6C2X1YwSBuk1iBYjtSYRjFV3wTTKLSAQQj6Z2vAfG6_em0493VUojBKC0uQUVBLAM=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/facebook_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"facebook_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\