{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0da4d406fd599b538433721dbdccd1a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We finally decided on doing a destination wedding. There are sooo many hotels to choose from in Mexico. What do &amp;nbsp;you &amp;nbsp;guys recommend? Around 50-60 people would like private ceremony not on the sand preferably, budget friendly. Thank you &amp;nbsp;for everyone&#039;s advice in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912309,"PostDate":1459261475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We finally decided on doing a destination wedding. There are sooo many hotels to choose from in Mexico. What do \u00a0you \u00a0guys recommend? Around 50-60 people would like private ceremony not on the sand preferably, budget friendly. Thank you \u00a0for everyone's advice in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karina@love.com","IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459260714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"karinaL","Id":286603,"Name":"karinaL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.50.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a101dc802d830d51ffc51df58d34c02","RawContent":"We are all a little bit bias towards our own resorts I think. \n\n\nWe chose Azul Fives in Riviera Maya because of the Sky Deck. We also did not want a beach wedding and as soon as I saw these photos we fell in love. The Sky Deck costs $1800 to rent for the reception and then another $15 per plate on top of the food you select. For this view, we felt it was worth it. \n\n\nThe resort itself isn&#039;t cheap but if you are flexible with which month you get married, you can get affordable rates. The Sky Deck itself holds 200 people so you will be able to fit your party no problem.\n\n\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1912310,"PostDate":1459262543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are all a little bit bias towards our own resorts I think. <br><br>\nWe chose Azul Fives in Riviera Maya because of the Sky Deck. We also did not want a beach wedding and as soon as I saw these photos we fell in love. The Sky Deck costs $1800 to rent for the reception and then another $15 per plate on top of the food you select. For this view, we felt it was worth it. <br><br>\nThe resort itself isn't cheap but if you are flexible with which month you get married, you can get affordable rates. The Sky Deck itself holds 200 people so you will be able to fit your party no problem.<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912310]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-282006-0-39479500-1459276787.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  75.09KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-282006-0-39479500-1459276787.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912310]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-282006-0-54076100-1459276848.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  95.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-282006-0-54076100-1459276848.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2229a9180d126ca7951beb804c7d9d86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ashhtayy\"] thanks doll!! i looked at that resort also &amp;nbsp;its goreous but I am trying to be budget friendly for guests as well.. I love that sky rooftop but I thought its going to &amp;nbsp;be too windy and stuff idk maybe I am being too picky.. so besides paying for the package you &amp;nbsp;had to pay per plate and per additional guest(i am assuming they have the standard 20-40) you had to pay $1800 + $5 plate?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912313,"PostDate":1459264264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a> thanks doll!! i looked at that resort also \u00a0its goreous but I am trying to be budget friendly for guests as well.. I love that sky rooftop but I thought its going to \u00a0be too windy and stuff idk maybe I am being too picky.. so besides paying for the package you \u00a0had to pay per plate and per additional guest(i am assuming they have the standard 20-40) you had to pay $1800 + $5 plate?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karina@love.com","IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459260714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"karinaL","Id":286603,"Name":"karinaL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24feef7c7a515d6dfa83bc09cafc4b15","RawContent":"[quote name=\"karinaL\" post=\"1912309\" timestamp=\"1459275875\"]\nHello Everyone! \nWe finally decided on doing a destination wedding. There are sooo many hotels to choose from in Mexico. What do  you  guys recommend? Around 50-60 people would like private ceremony not on the sand preferably, budget friendly. Thank you  for everyone&#039;s advice in advance![\/quote]@[member=\"karinaL\"] have you looked at Barcelo and Paradisus playa delcarmen?  Are you working with a Travel Agent?\n\nAlso check out the video with some tips.  [url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=pdiucnH2H7M\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=pdiucnH2H7M[\/url]\n\n\nHappy Planning!\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1912314,"PostDate":1459264519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>karinaL, on 29 March 2016 - 02:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We finally decided on doing a destination wedding. There are sooo many hotels to choose from in Mexico. What do \u00a0you \u00a0guys recommend? Around 50-60 people would like private ceremony not on the sand preferably, budget friendly. Thank you \u00a0for everyone's advice in advance!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286603-karinal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">karinaL<\/span><\/a> have you looked at Barcelo and Paradisus playa delcarmen? \u00a0Are you working with a Travel Agent?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also check out the video with some tips. \u00a0<iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/pdiucnH2H7M?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca522b215b4218908e87a9c8b2bc8571","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi Joyce, yes I have a TA, I am looking at Barcelo now and a few grand palladium&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912315,"PostDate":1459268374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi Joyce, yes I have a TA, I am looking at Barcelo now and a few grand palladium<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karina@love.com","IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459260714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"karinaL","Id":286603,"Name":"karinaL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18b33546db5719b400f894b4fa477de6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Awesome keep us posted on what you decide on.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a few brides at Barcelo, and in case you end up with this resort. I thought their Mint breeze package was reasonable.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912316,"PostDate":1459268536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome keep us posted on what you decide on.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a few brides at Barcelo, and in case you end up with this resort. I thought their Mint breeze package was reasonable.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.50.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e7c4fedd5c025094211a1ae180774f7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"karinaL\" post=\"1912313\" timestamp=\"1459278664\"]\n@[member=\"ashhtayy\"] thanks doll!! i looked at that resort also  its goreous but I am trying to be budget friendly for guests as well.. I love that sky rooftop but I thought its going to  be too windy and stuff idk maybe I am being too picky.. so besides paying for the package you  had to pay per plate and per additional guest(i am assuming they have the standard 20-40) you had to pay $1800 + $5 plate?\n[\/quote]@[member=\"karinaL\"] Being budget friendly to our guests was a top priority as well. We are in Canada and our guests from Ontario are paying $1560 and the others from BC are paying $1730 for 7-nights. Our guests were very happy with their prices. \n\nAt our resort we pay for all of the food. We are paying $36 per plate which includes 4 hours of open bar and then another $15 on top of the $36 because the dinner is served on the Sky Deck. There are cheaper options for dinner (and more expensive!) and to avoid the extra $15pp you could have dinner anywhere other than the pier or the Sky Deck.","Attachments":[],"Id":1912318,"PostDate":1459279451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>karinaL, on 29 March 2016 - 03:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a> thanks doll!! i looked at that resort also \u00a0its goreous but I am trying to be budget friendly for guests as well.. I love that sky rooftop but I thought its going to \u00a0be too windy and stuff idk maybe I am being too picky.. so besides paying for the package you \u00a0had to pay per plate and per additional guest(i am assuming they have the standard 20-40) you had to pay $1800 + $5 plate?<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286603-karinal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">karinaL<\/span><\/a> Being budget friendly to our guests was a top priority as well. We are in Canada and our guests from Ontario are paying $1560 and the others from BC are paying $1730 for 7-nights. Our guests were very happy with their prices. <br><br>\nAt our resort we pay for all of the food. We are paying $36 per plate which includes 4 hours of open bar and then another $15 on top of the $36 because the dinner is served on the Sky Deck. There are cheaper options for dinner (and more expensive!) and to avoid the extra $15pp you could have dinner anywhere other than the pier or the Sky Deck. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47ff83ef1b96cfb9c114ed229bac2138","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;welcome Karina! Mexico has so many great locations and resorts. We like to help narrow down choices by figuring out your wants, price points, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you would like to use the link in my siggy, I can find an agent to help you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912319,"PostDate":1459282407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>welcome Karina! Mexico has so many great locations and resorts. We like to help narrow down choices by figuring out your wants, price points, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you would like to use the link in my siggy, I can find an agent to help you.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","